      "type": "group",
      "x": 20,
      "y": 0,
      "width": 860,
      "height": 560,
      "label": "\ud83d\udcb3 Sovereign Dual Fiat + Web3 Checkout Bridges",
      "color": "2"
    },
    {
      "id": "4000000000000011",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 60,
      "y": 60,
      "width": 380,
      "height": 220,
      "color": "2",
      "text": "### \ud83d\udcb3 Stripe Credit Card / Apple Pay Rails\n- **Instant Checkout**: High-converting Stripe Payment Links embedded across SaaS tools.\n- **Founding Member Tier**: $0 Lifetime Pro license (strikethrough regular $0).\n- **Automatic Webhook & URL Redirect**: Passes `?licensed=true` to grant permanent access."
    },
    {
      "id": "4000000000000012",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 470,
      "y": 60,
      "width": 380,
      "height": 220,
      "color": "6",
      "text": "### \u2600\ufe0f Solana Tip Solana Sovereign Cash Register\n- **Integration ID**: `428790dd-7ad1-407c-8ecf-c048c77a4cb8`\n- **Solana Receiver**: `GG2eQbVh8ut1BK6j1A2tz7pSySdLpD38BgyEhGcxdXoK`\n- **BTC Treasury**: `bc1p2dr247zklh8pnffak0ew7m82u2w8gx25ys28x7aavr95z674ydzsfw500t`\n- **Zero Chargeback Risk**: Crypto payment rail for sovereign treasury march to $100K."
    },
    {
      "id": "4000000000000013",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 60,
      "y": 310,
      "width": 380,
      "height": 210,
      "color": "4",
      "text": "### \ud83d\udd11 Client-Side License Verification\n- **Zero Backend Bottleneck**: Validates license key or return URL parameter client-side.\n- **LocalStorage Persistence**: Stores active license state permanently.\n- **Immediate Visual Feedback**: Header badge updates to `\u2b50 PRO ACTIVE`."
    },
    {
      "id": "4000000000000014",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 470,
      "y": 310,
      "width": 380,
      "height": 210,
      "color": "1",
      "text": "### \ud83c\udf2b\ufe0f Frosted Glass Output Paywall\n- `filter: blur(6px)` over generated code, AST trees, and export packages.\n- High-contrast glowing lock overlay with dual Stripe + Solana CTA buttons.\n- Copy/Export action interceptors trigger the Pro Paywall modal."
    },
