      "width": 820,
      "height": 190,
      "color": "5",
      "text": "### \ud83d\udc8e Sovereign SaaS Design & Treasury Standards\n- **Zero Fake Work**: AST parsing, crypto transforms, and calculations run 100% in-browser.\n- **Avant-Garde UI/UX**: Syne/Space Grotesk typography, pure CSS border beams, dynamic aurora gradients.\n- **Subtle Attribution**: `Engineered by 1nc0gn30 (@1nc0gn30) \u2022 NullAI Platform`.\n- **Triple-Viewport Guardrail**: Multi-viewport verified, zero horizontal overflow, 0 console errors."
